<title>THAILAND: CP Feedmill sets 5.00 baht 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>CP Feedmill sets 5.00 baht 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  5.00    vs     5.70</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 29, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 21, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Charoen Pokphand Feedmill Plc is a producer of animal feeds.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
